$$SYNTAX-LEVEL 2

*(mgdb-maize-meeting

<main class="mgdb-page mgdb-meeting-page" id="mgdb-meeting-main">



  <nav class="mgdb-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">

    <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span><span aria-current="page">Maize Genetics Meeting</span>

  </nav>



  <section class="mgdb-hero" aria-labelledby="meeting-title">
    <div class="mgdb-hero-emblem">
      <img src="/images/maize_meeting/mgc-mark.png?v=1" alt="" />
      <strong>Maize Genetics<br />Meeting</strong>
      <span>Established 1959</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-hero-body">
      <span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Maize Genetics Cooperation</span>
      <h1 id="meeting-title">Where the maize community meets</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-tagline">The annual gathering of the international maize genetics community.</p>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">Share discoveries, start collaborations, and connect across disciplines. Meeting details, historical attendance and program trends, and the archive of past meeting websites.</p>
      <div class="mgdb-hero-actions">
        <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" href="#meeting-upcoming">See upcoming meetings</a>
        <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary" href="#meeting-archive">Browse the archive</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="meeting-upcoming" class="meeting-upcoming" aria-labelledby="meeting-upcoming-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Plan ahead</span><h2 id="meeting-upcoming-title">Upcoming meetings</h2></div>
      <p>Dates and locations link to the official Maize Genetics Meeting site.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="meeting-upcoming-grid">
      <a href="https\://www.maizegenetics.org/maize-meeting/2027" class="meeting-event-card meeting-event-featured"><span class="meeting-event-visual"><img src="/images/maize_meeting/chicago.png" alt="" /><strong>2027</strong></span><div><small>69th annual meeting</small><h3>Chicago, Illinois</h3><p>March 11–14 · Connect with maize researchers in the heart of the Midwest.</p></div><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
      <a href="https\://www.maizegenetics.org/maize-meeting/2028" class="meeting-event-card"><span class="meeting-event-visual"><img src="/images/maize_meeting/sacramento.png" alt="" /><strong>2028</strong></span><div><small>70th annual meeting</small><h3>Sacramento, California</h3><p>March 2–5 · A milestone edition at the SAFE Credit Union Convention Center.</p></div><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="meeting-overview" aria-labelledby="meeting-overview-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">A long-running scientific community</span><h2 id="meeting-overview-title">From twelve colleagues to a global meeting</h2></div>
      <p>Figures summarize the supplied meeting-history workbook through 2026. Blank historical fields are treated as not reported, never as zero.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="meeting-metric-grid">
      <article class="meeting-metric meeting-tone-gold"><span class="meeting-metric-icon" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><strong>68</strong><h3>annual meetings</h3><p>From the first gathering in 1959 through Cologne in 2026.</p></div></article>
      <article class="meeting-metric meeting-tone-red"><span class="meeting-metric-icon" aria-hidden="true">12</span><div><strong>12</strong><h3>first attendees</h3><p>The community’s recorded starting point at Allerton Park.</p></div></article>
      <article class="meeting-metric meeting-tone-amber"><span class="meeting-metric-icon" aria-hidden="true">06</span><div><strong>6</strong><h3>host countries</h3><p>United States, Mexico, Italy, China, France, and Germany.</p></div></article>
      <article class="meeting-metric meeting-tone-brown"><span class="meeting-metric-icon" aria-hidden="true">721</span><div><strong>721</strong><h3>peak reported attendance</h3><p>The 2021 virtual meeting; the in-person peak was 677 in 2017.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="meeting-dashboard" aria-labelledby="meeting-dashboard-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Meeting history at a glance</span><h2 id="meeting-dashboard-title">How the gathering has grown</h2></div>
      <p>Hover or tap the figures for exact values. The canceled Hawaii meeting is omitted; v2020 denotes its virtual replacement.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="meeting-chart-grid">
      <article class="meeting-chart-card">
        <div><span>Reported attendance</span><h3>Participation, 2000–2026</h3><p>Exact reported totals only. Virtual meetings are highlighted, and international hosts are labeled directly.</p></div>
        <div id="meeting-attendance-chart" class="meeting-chart" role="img" aria-label="Line chart of reported Maize Genetics Meeting attendance from 2000 through 2026"><span class="meeting-chart-fallback">Loading attendance history…</span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="meeting-chart-card">
        <div><span>Scientific program</span><h3>Talks, posters, and lightning talks</h3><p>Program counts for years with exact values; unreported categories remain blank.</p></div>
        <div id="meeting-program-chart" class="meeting-chart" role="img" aria-label="Stacked bar chart of talks, posters, and lightning talks from 2000 through 2026"><span class="meeting-chart-fallback">Loading program history…</span></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="meeting-journey" aria-labelledby="meeting-journey-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">A widening footprint</span><h2 id="meeting-journey-title">Milestones across seven decades</h2></div>
      <p>The meeting’s home has expanded from Allerton Park to international and virtual venues.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="meeting-timeline">
      <li><span>1959</span><strong>Allerton Park</strong><small>The first meeting brought together 12 maize geneticists in Illinois.</small></li>
      <li><span>2004</span><strong>Mexico City</strong><small>The first meeting in the supplied history held outside the United States.</small></li>
      <li><span>2008</span><strong>Washington, DC</strong><small>The 50th anniversary meeting convened in the nation’s capital to honor a half-century of achievement.</small></li>
      <li><span>2010–2018</span><strong>Italy, China, and France</strong><small>The international cadence broadened across Europe and Asia.</small></li>
      <li><span>2020–2021</span><strong>Virtual community</strong><small>Two online meetings kept research exchange moving during the pandemic.</small></li>
      <li><span>2026</span><strong>Cologne, Germany</strong><small>The 68th meeting continued the international tradition.</small></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="meeting-archive" class="meeting-archive" aria-labelledby="meeting-archive-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Explore the record</span><h2 id="meeting-archive-title">Meeting website archive</h2></div>
      <p>Search archived meeting sites by year or location. Digital sites are available for selected years.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="meeting-archive-tools">
      <label class="meeting-archive-search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><span class="mgdb-visually-hidden">Search meeting archives</span><input id="meeting-archive-query" type="search" placeholder="Search year or location…" autocomplete="off" /><button id="meeting-archive-clear" type="button" hidden>Clear</button></label>
      <div class="meeting-archive-filters" aria-label="Filter archives by period"><button type="button" class="is-active" data-meeting-period="all">All</button><button type="button" data-meeting-period="2020s">2020s</button><button type="button" data-meeting-period="2010s">2010s</button><button type="button" data-meeting-period="2000s">2000s</button><button type="button" data-meeting-period="1990s">1990s</button><button type="button" data-meeting-period="historic">Historic</button><span id="meeting-archive-count" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
    </div>
    <div id="meeting-archive-grid" class="meeting-archive-grid" aria-live="polite">
      <a href="/mgc/maizemeeting/2025"><span class="meeting-archive-thumb"><img src="/images/maize_meeting/stlouis.png" alt="" /></span><span class="meeting-archive-copy"><span class="meeting-archive-year">2025</span><strong>St. Louis, Missouri</strong><small>67th annual meeting</small></span></a>
      <a href="/mgc/maizemeeting/2024"><span class="meeting-archive-thumb"><img src="/images/maize_meeting/raleigh.png" alt="" /></span><span class="meeting-archive-copy"><span class="meeting-archive-year">2024</span><strong>Raleigh, North Carolina</strong><small>66th annual meeting</small></span></a>
      <a href="/mgc/maizemeeting/2023"><span class="meeting-archive-thumb"><img src="/images/maize_meeting/stlouis.png" alt="" /></span><span class="meeting-archive-copy"><span class="meeting-archive-year">2023</span><strong>St. Louis, Missouri</strong><small>65th annual meeting</small></span></a>
      <a href="/maize_meeting/v2020"><span class="meeting-archive-thumb"><img src="/images/maize_meeting/virtual.jpg" alt="" /></span><span class="meeting-archive-copy"><span class="meeting-archive-year">v2020</span><strong>Virtual</strong><small>62nd annual meeting · 670 attendees</small></span></a>
      <a href="/maize_meeting/2019"><span class="meeting-archive-thumb"><img src="/images/maize_meeting/stlouis.png" alt="" /></span><span class="meeting-archive-copy"><span class="meeting-archive-year">2019</span><strong>St. Louis, Missouri</strong><small>61st annual meeting</small></span></a>
      <a href="/maize_meeting/1959"><span class="meeting-archive-thumb"><img src="/maize_meeting/1959/images/allerton.jpg" alt="" /></span><span class="meeting-archive-copy"><span class="meeting-archive-year">1959</span><strong>Allerton Park, Illinois</strong><small>Original-meeting mock-up</small></span></a>
    </div>
    <div id="meeting-archive-empty" class="mgdb-empty" hidden><strong>No archived meeting sites match that search.</strong><button id="meeting-archive-reset" type="button">Reset archive</button></div>

    <details class="meeting-photo-credits">
      <summary>Photograph credits</summary>
      <p>Venue photographs are used under Creative Commons licences. Each is credited to its
      photographer below, with a link to the original.</p>
      <div id="meeting-photo-credits"></div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section class="meeting-resources" aria-label="Maize Genetics Meeting resources">
    <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Keep exploring</span><h2>Meeting information, community leadership, and history.</h2><p>Use the official sites for current details and MaizeGDB for the preserved scientific record.</p></div>
    <div>
      <a href="https\://www.maizegenetics.org/maize-meeting/2027"><strong>Official meeting website</strong><span>Registration, program, travel, and attendee resources</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
      <a href="https\://www.maizegenetics.org/maize-meeting/mgmsc"><strong>Steering committee</strong><span>Current members and meeting governance</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
      <a href="/maize_meeting/1959/"><strong>Visit the original meeting</strong><span>A playful reconstruction of the 1959 gathering</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
      <a href="https\://documents.maizegdb.org/maizemeeting/abstracts/"><strong>Abstract books</strong><span>Programs and abstracts preserved by MaizeGDB</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
    </div>
  </section>



</main>

)
